# AscendC custom kernel SOURCES must be committed (wheel ships sources;
# they are JIT-compiled by bisheng at import). Other *.cpp are
# Cython-generated and stay ignored.
!cupy/backends/ascend/kernels/*.cpp
# built aicore fatbins are cache artifacts, never commit
cupy/backends/ascend/kernels/_build/
# AOT fatbins: built by `setup.py build_ext` (CUPY_ASCEND_KERNEL_SOCS) and
# copied into the wheel; they are machine/SoC specific binaries, not sources.
cupy/backends/ascend/kernels/_aot/
build
.codebuddy/**
.agents/**
docs/references/**
tests/logs/**

bdist-wheel/**

